<title>HUNGARY: Hungary Nov trade deficit narrows to $136 mln.</title>
<headline>Hungary Nov trade deficit narrows to $136 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's trade deficit narrowed to $136 million in November 1996 from $164 million in October, figures released by the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) on Wednesday showed.</p>
<p>The country's trade gap was $127 million in November 1995.  </p>
<p>HUNGARY TRADE BALANCE ($ million)</p>
<p>		     NOV 96   OCT 96   JAN-NOV 96   JAN-NOV 95</p>
<p>    Exports	  1,283    1,409    12,788	 11,659</p>
<p>    Imports	  1,419    1,574    15,017	 13,852</p>
<p>    Trade balance   -136     -164    -2,229	 -2,193</p>
<p>NOTE - The central bank's figures are based on cash flows.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
